Check `C:\Users\omkar\OneDrive\Documents\Claude-Brain\job-agent\project-context.md`
Use qmd MCP first: `qmd search "keyword"` before reading any file

## Key files
- `src/job_agent/tailoring.py` — ATS scoring + resume tailoring
- `src/job_agent/scraping.py` — jobspy + Scrapling scraper
- `src/job_agent/latex.py` — resume builder (always 3 projects)
- `src/job_agent/ats.py` — ATS keyword scoring
- `data/resume_inventory.json` — resume content (edit to update resume)

## Common commands (use venv)
```powershell
# Search jobs
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m job_agent search-jobs --query "Backend Engineer" --location "India" --sites "linkedin" --results 20

# Analyze a job URL (with free Qwen3 AI)
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m job_agent analyze-job --url "URL" --track --use-agents

# Generate resumes
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m job_agent generate-resumes --output-dir outputs/resumes

# List tracked applications
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m job_agent list-applications
```

